A7=Assay | B7=Alternative splicing of exon 3 on the human SMN2 super minigene (SMN2Sup). 18-mer ASO microwalk across exon 3, all treatments at 5 nM, so ASO target position is the single variable. cDNA RT-PCR products resolved by PAGE and quantified by densitometry in GelAnalyzer.
A8=Gel layout | B8=Gel 7-7: ladder, Super Minigene Only, ScrMOE (scrambled control), ASOs A–E. Gel 7-9: ladder, ASOs F–K.
