A10=Confirmed absent bands | B10=Experimenter confirmed the exports are complete. Super Minigene Only and ScrMOE have no Band 2 row, so excluded volume is 0 in calculations. No artificial band rows are added to the raw tables.
A11=Calculation basis | B11=Ψ (%) = 100 × Band 1 / (Band 1 + Band 2) and Δ3 (%) = 100 × Band 2 / (Band 1 + Band 2), using raw band volumes. Band 1 (upper band) = exon 3 included; Band 2 (lower band) = exon 3 skipped. Ψ + Δ3 = 100 in every lane.
A12=Interpretation | B12=Each ASO was run once (n = 1), so there are no replicate statistics. 100% refers to quantified signal, not to absence of other transcripts. See Methods for the cross-gel caveat.
A13=Scope | B13=Only the two uploaded exports are analyzed. ASOs A–K cover nt 2–168 of exon 3.

